#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""The canon of the frontal figures: assets/story/canon.json (story/compose.js, medieval/figure.js, docs/story.md). Run from anywhere.
Tints, poses, what can be held, things that stand in a scene, who's who by dress and attribute, and the scenes: all of it data, no engine knows a scene's name.
Colours are NAMES here; each engine's `dye` says what a name is in its palette, so one Nativity is glass or stone. Grammar as in Greek's canon: { of: [...] } picks, { p, v } may be."""
